{"unit_id":"cwd514__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-zh","repo":"cwd514/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"8d07542ffdbc2878e1037dd87e7b9ab79584578e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的交互式可视化插件，通过注册 render_ui 工具，让模型以声明式区块生成回答视图。它支持图表、可排序表格、比较表、时间线、关系图、标签页和输入计算器等内容，并在工具运行时显示视图、回答完成后将视图放到对话下方。适合需要展示数据、比较方案或让用户调整参数的对话。安装插件即可使用，不要求额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:435-495","client.js:611-634","client.js:1299-1418","client.js:1782-1810"]}
{"unit_id":"cwd514__dsh-intelligent-ui#card-en","repo":"cwd514/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"8d07542ffdbc2878e1037dd87e7b9ab79584578e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Intelligent UI adds visual answers to DSH Web through a render_ui tool. It displays charts, sortable tables, comparisons, timelines, diagrams, and input driven calculators, keeping views below completed answers. It suits data displays and option comparisons; no extra key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:435-495","client.js:611-634","client.js:1299-1418","client.js:1782-1810"]}
