{"unit_id":"cwd514__dsh-intelligent-ui#feature-1","repo":"cwd514/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"8d07542ffdbc2878e1037dd87e7b9ab79584578e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 的功能「数据图表与表格」：模型可在回答中呈现柱形、折线或饼图，也可生成可排序的数据表。图表展示分类和数值系列，表格支持列格式化。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:691-789","client.js:796-987"]}
{"unit_id":"cwd514__dsh-intelligent-ui#feature-2","repo":"cwd514/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"8d07542ffdbc2878e1037dd87e7b9ab79584578e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 的功能「交互式参数计算」：视图可提供文本、数字、滑块、选项或复选框，用户更改输入后，计算区块会在浏览器内重新计算并显示结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1299-1405","client.js:429-503"]}
{"unit_id":"cwd514__dsh-intelligent-ui#feature-3","repo":"cwd514/dsh-intelligent-ui","commit":"8d07542ffdbc2878e1037dd87e7b9ab79584578e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Intelligent UI 的功能「视图随回答保留」：render_ui 调用进行时，插件在工具行绘制视图；回合关闭后，它把已完成的视图放到回答下方，便于继续查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1672-1710","client.js:1782-1810","client.js:2186-2200"]}
